------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

trica runs alongside, but does not embed:

  PostgreSQL          PostgreSQL   database (container image or external)

Go dependencies are declared in go.mod and go.sum, JavaScript dependencies in
web/pnpm-lock.yaml, and an SBOM ships with every release image.

trica embeds, unchanged, device model files from:

  netbox-community/devicetype-library   CC0-1.0 (public domain dedication)
    https://github.com/netbox-community/devicetype-library
    licence checked 2026-10-14, master at 565a9ba8e0a68a4fa102ce4b35f30c6695a2d574
    files: internal/devicetypes/library/<Vendor>/ (every directory but "trica"
    and "elevation-images")

and device face images from the same repository, scaled down and recompressed
(CC0 allows it; the list and the changes are in
internal/devicetypes/library/README.md):

  netbox-community/devicetype-library   CC0-1.0 (public domain dedication)
    licence checked 2026-10-17, master at 37f5f02c27eedf60767594174598daec5b9e2bee
    files: internal/devicetypes/library/elevation-images/

The models in internal/devicetypes/library/trica/ are written by this project.

The colour tokens of the web UI (web/src/styles/tokens.css) are steps of:

